{
  "slug": "arcanum",
  "name": "Arcanum",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Advanced debugging, code review, deep research, technical documentation, creative ideation, and semi-autonomous development workflows with parallel theory validation, team-based research, war room investigation, root cause analysis, PR review assistance, elite technical writing, and Maestro development pipeline",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**, **31 agents** and **9 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `arc-maestro-feature-planner` (Generate one or more production stories from product docs or a description), `arc-maestro-prototype-planner` (Generate a prototype story from a product document (Notion export, PDF, markdown)), `arc-maestro-vet-stories` (Audit a story backlog for quality and coherence), `arc-pr-respond` (Analyze feedback on your GitHub pull request, validate each actionable item, and produce a prioritized analysis with recommended…), `arc-pr-review` (Comprehensive code review of a GitHub PR or local branch with a strict two-agent workflow (pass1 reviewer +…), `arc-rubber-duck` (Be a thoughtful sounding board for a developer presenting a technical idea, design, or plan), `arc-vet` (Review recent work with an agent, vet feedback, and recommend worthwhile changes), `arc-vet-apply` (Apply recommendations from a prior /vet or /vet-wf run), and 1 more\n- **Agents** (31): `arc-code-reviewer` (Standalone code review agent for direct invocation without the full orchestrated workflow), `arc-deep-research` (Deep investigative research using a four-step methodology (Define → Execute → Verify → Polish) that prioritizes correctness and…), `arc-root-cause-analyzer` (Forensic bug analysis using git archaeology), `arc-technical-writer` (Create and modify technical documentation (markdown, code comments, architecture docs) for developers and LLMs), `ca-backlog-auditor` (Audits development backlogs at element level (each work item) and collection level (all items together)), `ca-brainstormer` (Internal agent used by arc-investigate), `ca-code-review-validator` (Shared validator for arc-pr-review and arc-pr-respond workflows), `ca-maestro-batch-validator` (Batch validates all difficulty ≤3 tasks at once after development completes), and 23 more\n- **Commands** (9): `arc-investigate`, `arc-llm`, `arc-maestro-review` (Code review and PR creation — two-pass review with enhanced bug-finding, fixes bugs with regression tests, creates PR), `arc-maestro` (Semi-autonomous development pipeline — researches codebase, creates plan, implements tasks with specialist routing, validates each task), `arc-rca`, `arc-research-team` (Team-based parallel deep research — decomposes complex questions into threads investigated by parallel researcher agents, then synthesizes into…), `arc-think-tank` (Creative ideation workflow — generates, critiques, evolves, and ranks ideas toward a goal through 5 rounds of thinking,…), `arc-war-room` (Team-based parallel investigation — brainstorms theories, dispatches parallel investigators, dynamically spawns new investigators for discovered leads, and synthesizes…), and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install arcanum@claude-community` from `burnsbert/claude-arcanum`.",
